<Layout title="Digital delivery — Rakhi Battle 2026" noindex>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <h1>Digital delivery</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 24 August 2026.</p>
    <h2>Free experience</h2>
    <p>The score, relationship type, two memory teasers, free result card and chain features appear as soon as both siblings complete the battle.</p>
    <h2>Paid upgrades</h2>
    <p>The ₹49 Reveal opens both exact answers for all eight questions. The ₹99 Rakhi Gift Pack also opens the premium poster and sibling certificate. The same private link delivers the purchase to both siblings; there is no physical shipping.</p>
    <h2>If delivery does not appear</h2>
    <p>First refresh the result page. If a successful debit is still not reflected, use the <a href="/contact">support form</a>, select Payment or delivery, and include the battle code plus payment reference. Do not send card, bank account, UPI PIN or OTP details.</p>
